he Netherlands and Russia, with each country having at least one bona fide superstar in their ranks.  The South Africans sent out " [:a {:href "/athletes/93731"} "Roland Schoeman"] ", their fastest swimmer, on the opening leg and he opened up a lead that never looked like being closed down.  " [:a {:href "/athletes/50013"} "Ryk Neethling"] " anchored the team to a new world record as they finished over a second ahead of a fast finishing Netherlands team with the USA having to settle for third place."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Competitors"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "R1"] [:th {} "Final"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {} "South Africa"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/RSA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/RSA.png"}] "RSA"]] [:td {} "3:13.84 (1 h1)"] [:td {} "3:13.17 (1)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {}] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/103419"} "Lyndon Ferns"] " "] [:td {}] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {}] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/50013"} "Ryk Neethling"] " "] [:td {}] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {}] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/93731"} "Roland Schoeman"] " "] [:td {}] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {}] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/103420"} "Darian Townsend"] " "] [:td {}] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {} "Netherlands"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/NED"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/NED.png"}] "NED"]] [:td {} "3:16.42 (4 h1)"] [:td {} "3:14.36 (2)"] [:td {} [:span {:class